{"Guest normalization/deduping is missing: blacklist entries are lowercased but guest isn't, and duplicates/whitespace/case variants can slip through, potentially bypassing BLACKLISTED_GUEST_EMAILS and causing duplicate attendee inserts": 0.9870692491531372, "isTeamAdminOrOwner currently requires the user to be both team admin AND team owner instead of OR semantics, which will wrongly forbid legitimate team admins/owners from adding guests": 0.9848259687423706, "Email sender is passed the raw guests array but handler filters to uniqueGuests before writing attendees, which can misclassify existing/blacklisted/duplicate entries as newGuests and send wrong email template": 0.9876599907875061, "sendAddGuestsEmails always emails organizer + attendees but doesn't respect eventTypeDisableHostEmail / eventTypeDisableAttendeeEmail like other booking-update emails do": 0.9769654273986816, "Group label uses htmlFor='emails' but rendered inputs don't have matching id, so label isn't associated with any control (hurts screen-reader and click-to-focus behavior)": 0.8662046194076538, "Remove-email control has hard-coded English tooltip and icon-only button lacks accessible label - should use translated text and add aria-label for screen readers": 0.8972461223602295, "Once isInvalidEmail is set, it never clears when user edits the email list, so error stays visible even after input becomes valid until next submit/cancel": 0.9509456157684326}